OL,3,GNEWSAVictim 'angry' at voyeur being
OL,4,Agiven leave to appeal
OL,5,
OL,6,FA victim of a serial voyeur says she is
OL,7,F"angry" after finding out the man who
OL,8,Fsecretly filmed her in her house had
OL,9,Fbeen given leave to appeal his sentence
OL,10,Fthrough the media.
OL,12,FKirk Bishop, 40, was granted leave to
OL,13,Fappeal his six-year royal court
OL,14,Fsentence after a judge found there were
OL,15,Fgrounds he should have received greater
OL,16,Fcredit for his guilty pleas and
OL,17,Fco-operation with police.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
