OL,3,GNEWSAVictim 'angry' at voyeur being
OL,4,Agiven leave to appeal
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of Bishop's 14 victims, Lucy
OL,7,FDomaille was critical of the notice she
OL,8,Freceived of the appeal: "To wake up and
OL,9,Ffind this out, angry is probably an
OL,10,Funderstatement."
OL,12,FOfficials from Guernsey's Court of
OL,13,FAppeal said the next hearing will be in
OL,14,FDecember. Guernsey Police has been
OL,15,Fapproached for comment.
